{
  "name": "terraform-iac",
  "description": "Lay out a Terraform repo, pick an environment pattern, pin versions, set up remote state with locking on S3, GCS, Azure or HCP Terraform, design modules and variables, handle secrets, lint and scan, test modules, import, refactor and repair state, review and policy-gate plans, guard against destroys, gate CI plan and apply, and detect drift.",
